    "detailed_description": "You play as a cyber enhanced warrior in a pixel art future.<br />\r\nYour mission is to defeat all enemies and kill their big boss.<br />\r\nTry to get better game score every time you play, to make future play throughs easier.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- over 30 different types of weapons<br />\r\n- 24 types of enemies<br />\r\n- 40 different skills/cybernetics to use<br />\r\n- multiple maps<br />\r\n- multiple boss enemies<br />\r\n- different game modes on every levels<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdvance in game and collect bigger score to unlock more cybernetics and weapons.<br />\r\nYou can use your collected points to equip unlocked weapons or keep them to the end to unlock more stuff.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nARENA GAME MODE<br />\r\nSurvive in the arena against growing number of enemies. Longer you last. tougher the enemies get.<br />\r\nTwo new maps to play the game mode.",
